# Ideas — apps that are not projects yet (kit#284 slice 4).
#
# kit:idea
#   Read by Kit: this file is the Ideas page, and it is kept off the board — an idea
#   is not work until it graduates. James, in Kit (2026-10-15 23:10Z): "I would love to
#   have a section on kit where i can add app ideas… just ramble about app ideas and
#   begin to build a spec."
#
# How it works: each `feature` below is one idea. Ramble about any of them (or a new
# one) as a note on this project, and the agent folds the ramble into that idea's
# behaviours here. An idea GRADUATES by moving its behaviours into their own
# <app>.beh beside a repo — creating repos stays James's call (kit#284).

feature FEAT-IDEA-MAHJONG "Mahjong: a polished app that prompts the tile names in English or pinyin"
feature FEAT-IDEA-SHENGJI "Sheng ji: a polished, playable app"
feature FEAT-IDEA-PHLOG "Phlog: a photo blog, where the words lead and the photos sit in tiles"
feature FEAT-IDEA-COACH "A personal training monitor: records activities and gives feedback on training"

behaviour BEH-IDEA-MAHJONG-1 "Each tile can be named in English or in pinyin, the player's choice"
  in FEAT-IDEA-MAHJONG
  source defined claude-code-bot#110
  priority 5
  pending
  needs-context "Should mahjong become a project? If yes, create a repo and tell me its name; I cannot create one. Until then it stays an idea."
  actor player
  contract the bridge to language-vocab: its mahjong vocab pack (BEH-PACK-1) teaches the same tile names

behaviour BEH-IDEA-MAHJONG-2 "A game of mahjong can be played in the browser or on a phone"
  in FEAT-IDEA-MAHJONG
  source defined claude-code-bot#110
  priority 5
  pending
  needs-context "Should mahjong become a project? If yes, create a repo and tell me its name; I cannot create one. Until then it stays an idea."
  actor player
  contract "just turn these amazing games into fun playable web apps and or mobile apps"

behaviour BEH-IDEA-SHENGJI-1 "A game of sheng ji can be played in the browser or on a phone"
  in FEAT-IDEA-SHENGJI
  source defined claude-code-bot#110
  priority 5
  pending
  needs-context "Should sheng ji become a project? If yes, create a repo and tell me its name; I cannot create one. Until then it stays an idea."
  actor player
  contract "just turn these amazing games into fun playable web apps and or mobile apps"

behaviour BEH-IDEA-PHLOG-1 "A post's photos can be arranged and resized in a tiled layout, several to a row"
  in FEAT-IDEA-PHLOG
  source defined ideas.notes.md#2026-10-18-1517
  priority 5
  pending
  needs-context "Should the photo blog become a project? If yes, create a repo and tell me its name; I cannot create one. Until then it stays an idea."
  actor writer
  contract "On Substack it only allows you to upload photos one per row… She would love to be able to arrange and resize the photos in a tile format"
  contract the arrangement is made inside the post editor, so no separate app (Canva today) is needed

behaviour BEH-IDEA-PHLOG-2 "A post reads as words first, with the photo tiles placed between its paragraphs"
  in FEAT-IDEA-PHLOG
  source inferred ideas.notes.md#2026-10-18-1517
  priority 5
  review unreviewed
  pending
  actor reader
  contract "Like Instagram or Pinterest but more focused on the words"

behaviour BEH-IDEA-PHLOG-3 "Readers can subscribe to a phlog and receive each new post"
  in FEAT-IDEA-PHLOG
  source inferred ideas.notes.md#2026-10-18-1517
  priority 5
  review unreviewed
  pending
  actor reader
  contract "pretty much like Substack but more focused on images", so following a writer is part of it

# Garmin's Connect Developer Program (Activity API) has been paused since ~2026-09 and
# rejects personal-use applicants (measured 2026-10-26). So "from Garmin" has no
# official route today. A FIT-file import or Strava as the source are the reachable ones.
behaviour BEH-IDEA-COACH-1 "A finished activity is recorded automatically, from a hook rather than by hand"
  in FEAT-IDEA-COACH
  source defined ideas.notes.md#2026-10-26-2303
  priority 5
  pending
  needs-context "Garmin's developer API is paused and refuses personal use, so it can't be the source today. Should this become a project, built on tracks' Strava sync instead? I'd keep it an idea until tracks' Strava-or-Garmin question is settled."
  actor athlete
  contract "Records activities from Garmin, triggered from hook"

behaviour BEH-IDEA-COACH-2 "The athlete gets feedback on their training"
  in FEAT-IDEA-COACH
  source defined ideas.notes.md#2026-10-26-2303
  priority 5
  review unreviewed
  pending
  actor athlete
  contract "able to give feedback on training"

behaviour BEH-IDEA-COACH-3 "The athlete can chat with the AI about their training"
  in FEAT-IDEA-COACH
  source defined ideas.notes.md#2026-10-26-2303
  priority 5
  review unreviewed
  pending
  actor athlete
  contract "A chat feature where the human can chat with the ai about training"
